# Title: Macro Enabled In A Potentially Suspicious Document
# ID: a166f74e-bf44-409d-b9ba-ea4b2dd8b3cd
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-06-21
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1112
# Description: Detects registry changes to Office trust records where the path is located in a potentially suspicious location
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((TargetObject CONTAIN "/AppData/Local/Microsoft/Windows/INetCache/" OR TargetObject CONTAIN "/AppData/Local/Temp/" OR TargetObject CONTAIN "/PerfLogs/" OR TargetObject CONTAIN "C:/Users/Public/" OR TargetObject CONTAIN "file:///D:/" OR TargetObject CONTAIN "file:///E:/")) AND (TargetObject CONTAIN "\\Security\\Trusted Documents\\TrustRecords"))
